Seeded defect for tests/BLite.Tests/Oracles/DifferentialQueryTests.cs

This is `git revert --no-commit f8f437b` restricted to src/ (the fix for #206: typed string
index bounds matched every longer value starting with the searched one, so Name == "p7" also
returned "p70".."p79" and StartsWith("p7") also returned "p8".."p89"). With it applied, 22
additional rows of the differential test fail on upstream 0450b97, e.g. `name == p7`,
`name startswith p7`, `Count(name == p7)`, `name in list`, `nick == ab`.

Reproduce: git revert --no-commit f8f437b && git checkout HEAD -- tests && dotnet test tests/BLite.Tests --filter FullyQualifiedName~DifferentialQueryTests
Restore:   git reset --hard HEAD

The source files use CRLF line endings; apply with `git apply --ignore-whitespace` if the
patch was normalised. Never commit the seeded state.

